### 2.2 维度一致性校验 [🔴 严重]

**问题**：仅检查模型ID，未检查Embedding维度是否匹配。

**修复方案**：

#### [MODIFY] [program_b/lib/services/asset_loader_service.dart](file:///d:/CodingProjects/DartProject/Embedding_Legal_Engine/program_b/lib/services/asset_loader_service.dart)

```dart
ValidationResult validateAssetConsistency({
  String? currentModelId,
  int? currentDimension,  // 新增参数
}) {
  // 检查模型ID
  if (currentModelId != null && 
      embeddingPackage!.embeddingModelId != currentModelId) {
    return ValidationResult(
      isValid: false,
      errorMessage: '模型不匹配: 包=${embeddingPackage!.embeddingModelId}, 配置=$currentModelId',
    );
  }
  
  // 新增：检查维度
  if (currentDimension != null) {
    final pkgDim = embeddingPackage!.embeddings.first.embedding.length;
    if (pkgDim != currentDimension) {
      return ValidationResult(
        isValid: false,
        errorMessage: '维度不匹配: 包=$pkgDim, 配置=$currentDimension',
      );
    }
  }
  
  return ValidationResult(isValid: true);
}
```

