### 2.5 法律条文加载修复 [🔴 严重]

**问题**：[loadArticlesFromDirectory](file:///d:/CodingProjects/DartProject/Embedding_Legal_Engine/program_a/lib/providers/app_provider.dart#214-233)未正确递归遍历子目录，导致加载0篇文章。

**修复方案**：

#### [MODIFY] [program_a/lib/services/embedding_service.dart](file:///d:/CodingProjects/DartProject/Embedding_Legal_Engine/program_a/lib/services/embedding_service.dart)

```dart
Future<List<LawArticle>> loadArticlesFromDirectory(String directoryPath) async {
  final dir = Directory(directoryPath);
  if (!await dir.exists()) {
    throw Exception('目录不存在: $directoryPath');
  }
  
  final articles = <LawArticle>[];
  
  // 递归遍历所有子目录
  await for (final entity in dir.list(recursive: true, followLinks: false)) {
    if (entity is File && 
        (entity.path.endsWith('.md') || entity.path.endsWith('.txt'))) {
      final content = await entity.readAsString();
      final parsed = LawArticleParser.parseMarkdown(content, entity.path);
      articles.addAll(parsed);
    }
  }
  
  return articles;
}
```

